'''Bunnies''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that was obtainable by collecting 4,000 [[Eggs (Currency)|eggs]]{{Currency|Egg2025}}, then claiming it from the [[Easter Event 2025]] Tier Rewards.

== Appearance ==
The knife has a pastel lavender colour throughout it, the handle includes a gradient of pastel pink-fuchsia, the blade includes two cartoon bunnies holding light blue and yellow easter eggs, hence the name.

